# Tic Tac Toe Game in C++

## Description
A console-based Tic Tac Toe game developed in C++ using arrays, loops, functions, and conditional statements.

## Features
- Two-player mode
- Dynamic board display
- Win/loss detection
- Draw detection
- Replay option
- Input validation

## Technologies Used
- C++
- Object-Oriented Concepts
- Console Programming

## How to Run

### Compile
g++ main.cpp game.cpp -o game

### Run
./game

## Project Structure
- main.cpp → Main function
- game.h → Function declarations
- game.cpp → Game logic

